cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "The Front Desk Review — front-office software pricing dataset"
abstract: >-
  Independent, sourced pricing and capability data for the software that runs the
  front office of a local-service business: AI receptionists, call tracking, business
  texting, and online booking. Every figure is traced to its source (the vendor pricing
  page URL and the date it was captured) and, where possible, corroborated by a second
  independent source. Quote-only tiers are recorded with a null price rather than a guess.
authors:
  - name: "The Front Desk Review"
type: dataset
version: "2026-06-12"
date-released: "2026-06-12"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://frontdeskreview.com/data"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AlexandDunk/frontdesk-data"
keywords:
  - open-data
  - pricing-data
  - saas-pricing
  - ai-receptionist
  - call-tracking
  - business-texting
  - online-booking
